mapping "X676.1" source="X676" target="271982007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X676 SNOMED CT 271982007 = a Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension that subdivides X67
        (Athena ICD10 concept 45604952) by Swedish place/activity axes with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 4152376 = (sctid 271982007), the verified Athena crosswalk target for
        X67 (ICD10 relationship 45604952 -> 4152376). Why this target: it is the authoritative standard
        concept the parent X67 maps to, and the SE subdivision is fully contained by it.
        mapping_type=broader (target subsumes the source). Confidence (high): verified crosswalk with a
        small, well-understood breadth mismatch. Athena-local research only.
        """
}
